Description: ProxiLens Duo desktop application and optional system integrations
 ProxiLens provides a desktop application with packaged PAM, PolicyKit, GNOME
 extension and wake-agent components. Privileged authentication integrations
 remain opt-in and are activated or removed separately from the GUI.
